  "name": "momentum",
  "vibe": "A kinetic-velocity film. A near-black warm ground with cream ink and one hot vermilion, and a horizontal motion axis on every single beat. Headlines arrive as whole words sliding out of hard-edged masks; speed rules streak in from the left and settle; a marquee of the beat's OWN words scrolls through the middle band. Pictures ride two devices — a wide browser card that throws in from the right, and a bezelled phone that rises from below — plus a two-row gallery grid whose second column can give way to an accent-tinted figure tile. The opening lockup and the close are type and mark only. Authored landscape-first (16:9) as a native GSAP + DOM composition. Best for sport, automotive, fintech, agencies and any brand whose pitch is speed.",
